// example, the name of a feature might be "Zack's Pizza" and its
// address would be "123 Main Street". Similarly, streets, cities, and
// counties do not include themselves as part of their address. The
// address of "Seattle" is "King County, Washington, USA". If want to
// construct an address that *does* include the feature name, you can
// simply prepend it to the other address components. - Lakes,
// mountains, and other natural features do not normally have addresses.
