	// temporary closures, with the feature's data owner choosing which
	// range of past and future closures to permit or guarantee to keep. All
	// start and end dates must be unique from each other. If two
	// consecutive dates are a start and an end of a TemporaryClosureProto,
	// then the two dates must be from the same TemporaryClosureProto.
