	//   "RENDER_TRIVIAL" - Render with minimum resources, i.e., turn on
	// readonly fetch, turn off js and turn off snapshot.
	//   "RENDER_LIGHT" - Light weight rendering does not generate snapshot.
	//   "RENDER_CONTROL" - Light weight rendering but we will try our best
	// during rendering and fetching.
	//   "RENDER_FULL" - Render with standard features: fetching all
	// embedded links, turn on javascript, generate snapshot.
