	// Possible values:
	//   "UNSPECIFIED"
	//   "GENERIC" - Interstitial content analysis was run, but failed to
	// determine a particular content type.
	//   "APP_INSTALL_PROMO" - Interstitial content appears to promote a
	// mobile app install.
	//   "COOKIE" - Interstitial content appears to be in response to legal
	// obligation to warn users about usage of cookies on the web page.
	//   "ADULT_CONTENT" - Interstitial content appears to be in response to
	// legal obligation to warn users about adult content on the web page.
	//   "LOGIN" - Interstitial content appears to be asking users to login.
	// Also the page seems to have private content that is not publicly
	// viewable.
	//   "HEALTH_CARE_PROFESSIONAL" - Interstitial content appears to be
	// asking users whether they are health care professionals.
	//   "WHITELISTED" - A special type indicating whitelisted content that
	// never violates interstitial policy.
	//   "ADS" - Interstitial content appears to be ads.
	//   "SUBSCRIPTION" - Interstitial content appears to be asking users to
	// subscribe to newsletter.
