// following are the possible chain id forms: 1) prominent_entity_id
// only: The entity uniquely represents a chain, which may have multiple
// sitechunks. 2) sitechunk only: The sitechunk uniquely represents a
// chain while the chain currently does not have an entity in KG. 3)
// prominent_entity_id + sitechunk: The chain could be represented by
// the entity, but not merged at last, and the sitechunks represents the
// chain better. 4) prominent_entity_id + category: There are multiple
