	//   "REASON_INDEXING_OVERRIDE" - Overridden in indexing:
	//   "REASON_UPLIFTED" - Copyright holder explicitly allowed this:
	//   "REASON_OUTSTANDING_QUESTIONS" - Human QA questions for the book
