	// or annotator.
	//   "PLAY_APPS_SEARCH"
	//   "ASSISTANT_DEVICE_MODEL_CONTEXT" - Apps are annotated from
	// Assistant AppCapabilities, which will come from Device Model.
	//   "DEVICE_ATTRIBUTE" - Apps are annotated from device attribute.
	//   "TELEPORT_SEARCH" - Used by TeleportIntentGenerator for queries
	// such as Search $Entity on $APP.
	//   "FOREGROUND_SEARCH" - Used by TeleportIntentGenerator for queries
	// such searchy queries that fit the current foreground app. Example:
