	//   "AGGRESSIVE_IMPLICIT_SEARCH" - Used by TeleportIntentgenerator for
	// queries such as "install amazon" to be directed for PlayStore. Search
	// frames should directly trigger on this intent.
	//   "EMPTY_SEARCH" - Used by the TeleportIntentGenerator such as
